      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, i'm working on a piece about the future of work and how ai is basically gonna change everything. i'm trying to frame it—is the shift to an automated economy just this inevitable social evolution that's gonna happen regardless, or is it actually a policy choice that we can control? looking for some context for my article.",
