      "role": "user",
      "content": "wait, that sounds pretty one-sided lol. aren't there people who argue that the tech is just moving too fast for any policy to actually matter? like, once the compute and the algorithms are out there, isn't it basically a runaway train at that point regardless of what regulators do?",
