      "content": "The pressure of global competition is a real threat, but it is not an excuse to abandon regulation; instead, it demands we lead with bold, coordinated international standards rather than caving to the lowest common denominator. If we allow unregulated AI to drive down wages and erode labor rights, we aren't just losing economic relevance; we are sacrificing our democratic future and social stability for hollow growth. We have the power to build a framework where innovation serves humanity, and choosing otherwise is a moral failure, not just an economic one.",
